/app/reports/ + report.pdf
Which becomes:
/app/reports/report.pdf

Now the attacker attempts traversal:
GET /download?file=../../config/database.yml
The final path becomes:
/app/reports/../../config/database.yml
When the OS resolves the path:
/app/reports/../../config/database.yml
       ↑
reports/.. → /app
       ↑
app/.. → /

Final path:
/config/database.yml

The file contains:
DB_HOST
DB_USER
